AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]CI and the release train unblock.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]record_capture_repairs.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/record_capture_repairs.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-l3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-l3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Migrate the record-surface tests off the retired records [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]config (bob-cli)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-tests[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-tests: port the RecordVault and sibling fixtures from the retired [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]records: config to real album notes across capture_complete, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture_parse, capture_related, capture album_index, albums registry, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank import_run, and the CLI suite, and refresh the stale root-help [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot, so the 45 lib and 2 CLI failures at b04120b0 go green without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]product changes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record route rows accept again (bob-mac-capture)[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-accept[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-accept: narrow acceptSelectedCompletion's record dispatch to Record [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Card contexts so route lists accept record rows through the generic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]replacement path with their next-missing-field continuation, apply the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus_commit_record_rows decision in commitRouteCompletionOnAcceptKey, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and add Return/Tab/click and cached-targets regression tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Graceful bare-album refusal and a live rewrite button [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF](bob-mac-capture)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-accept[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-preview: give the live preview a dedicated album_holds_no_tasks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refusal presentation per the album_refusal_presentation decision, gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the footer rewrite button on parse currency and clear latestParse on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reset so it cannot go stale, and cover both with fake-bob dry-run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fixture tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-l3","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-l3.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-121a8eb3916aea9ad758d1994046a511","started_at":"2026-11-12T21:13:48.086411+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"d881d0084c36316fdf8b455974f0e0b3b6f746bfec77a18ad64d5e0cf7143375","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-l3.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"f0a35db76bcacba5bfa444b64b8bd376f4d671515c6ddfe9bea2818f6d639a8f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-l3.land/meta.json","size_bytes":692},"prompt":{"digest":"69aa6d7b6b18f2355c1cdc4fc099191b723fa1cd931395516a77b72ea94d2e31","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-l3.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":238},"state":{"digest":"ccc86bf0838ea3d44650f359aae534cb3a7fed23d5747e9b718fd7dc0e1ea4e7","path":"agents/b